# Google Ads conversion tracking
# Real values must be set in .env.local (gitignored) for local dev,
# and in Vercel project Environment Variables (Production + Preview) for deployed envs.
# When PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ADS_ID is unset, the gtag base script is not rendered and conversion calls no-op.
# These are PUBLIC_ values (shipped in client JS) — safe to record here.
# whatsapp_lead / call_lead / form_lead conversion actions in the AW-17767525580 account.
